WEBVTT

00:08:59.763 --> 00:09:01.771
confidently say that

00:09:01.771 --> 00:09:04.493
you're basically a form of birth control."

00:09:04.493 --> 00:09:07.771
Well!

00:09:07.771 --> 00:09:11.363
(Laughter)

00:09:11.363 --> 00:09:14.738
What a liberating thought! Yes!

00:09:14.738 --> 00:09:17.803
And after a couple very liberating weekends,

00:09:17.803 --> 00:09:19.243
my wife and I,

00:09:19.243 --> 00:09:23.131
utilizing some cutting-edge erectile technology

00:09:23.131 --> 00:09:25.715
that is certainly worthy of a TEDTalk someday

00:09:25.715 --> 00:09:27.746
but I won't get into it now,

00:09:27.746 --> 00:09:32.498
we noticed some familiar, if unexpected, symptoms.